WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:132000

cue-1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.340
As an independent freelancer in India,
figuring out which tax and compliance

cue-2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.530
rules apply to me can feel overwhelming.

cue-3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.710
If I Google "Indian freelancer tax
filing," there's plenty of information.

cue-4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.340
But which parts apply to me,

cue-5
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.960
and what do I actually do next?

cue-6
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.840
That's why I built my next filing.

cue-7
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.890
Let me show you an example.

cue-8
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.190
I start by answering a few questions about
my work,

cue-9
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.040
enter my income and taxes already paid,

cue-10
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.920
review my answers,

cue-11
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:34.570
and calculate my plan. Here's my next
action,

cue-12
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:41.180
the date, and the estimated amount left to
pay. Below it, you can view all upcoming

cue-13
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.070
compliances for the whole tax year.

cue-14
00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.690
I can also check the calculation here

cue-15
00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.540
and open the official how-to guide for the
related portal.

cue-16
00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.960
I can also save my data in this browser
and record what I've completed.

cue-17
00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.820
I still file and pay through the official
portals,

cue-18
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.200
but this app gives me some much needed
peace of mind.

cue-19
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:06.620
My last submission was a proof of concept
built in 24 hours.

cue-20
00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.640
This round, I built a more user-friendly
app with a lot more features.

cue-21
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.880
It now supports more work types, including
eligible work through platforms like

cue-22
00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.720
Upwork and overseas clients. But the
biggest change?

cue-23
00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.020
What happens when I come back?

cue-24
00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.460
I reopen my saved plan,

cue-25
00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.820
update the amount paid, and recalculate.

cue-26
00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.500
The balance is now 0.

cue-27
00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:35.940
I mark that action completed, and the next
action changes.

cue-28
00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.240
The plan constantly reflects my progress.

cue-29
00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:44.720
All my answers stay in this browser, and
the calculations happen here, too.

cue-30
00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.260
I've simplified the questions and added
help text wherever necessary.

cue-31
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:54.720
Unsupported answers get an immediate
explanation, so I know when this tool

cue-32
00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:55.320
can't help.

cue-33
00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:57.720
The question stays the same:

cue-34
00:01:58.540 --> 00:01:59.860
What should I file next?

cue-35
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.360
Now, I can keep coming back to the answer.
